sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Activity as TaskDetailsActivity
    participant VM as TaskViewModel
    participant Repo as TaskRepository
    participant Dao as TaskDao
    participant DB as AppDatabase
    participant Client as TaskApiClient
    participant API as Mock REST API
    participant DTO as ApiTaskDto
    participant Mapper as ApiTaskMapper

    User->>Activity: Open TaskDetailsActivity
    Activity->>VM: Start collecting task StateFlows
    VM-->>Activity: Expose allTasks and filteredTasks

    Note over VM,DB: Existing verified Room data path
    VM->>Repo: Observe/request task data
    Repo->>Dao: Request local tasks
    Dao->>DB: Execute Room query
    DB-->>Dao: Return stored records
    Dao-->>Repo: Return Flow of TaskEntity list
    Repo-->>VM: Expose local task data
    VM-->>Activity: Publish task UI state through StateFlow

    Note over Repo,API: Proposed API retrieval through TaskApiClient (PENDING - TRAINER APPROVAL)
    Repo->>Client: Request task retrieval
    Client->>API: Proposed GET /api/v1/tasks

    alt API success with task records
        API-->>Client: Return JSON task response
        Client->>DTO: Deserialize JSON into List<ApiTaskDto>
        DTO-->>Client: Return parsed DTO list
        Client-->>Repo: Return parsed API task data
        Repo->>Mapper: Map DTOs into approved application model
        Mapper-->>Repo: Return mapped task data
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed successful retrieval result
        VM-->>Activity: Publish updated UI state through StateFlow
        Note over Repo,DB: API data persistence or Room merge remains PENDING - TRAINER APPROVAL

    else Successful empty JSON array
        API-->>Client: Return empty JSON array []
        Client-->>Repo: Return empty parsed task list
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed empty-result state
        VM-->>Activity: Publish approved empty or cached UI state
        Note over Repo,Activity: Effect on existing Room records is PENDING - TRAINER APPROVAL

    else HTTP 204 No Content
        API-->>Client: Return HTTP 204 without response body
        Client-->>Repo: Return no-content result
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed no-content state
        VM-->>Activity: Publish approved no-content or cached UI state
        Note over Repo,Activity: HTTP 204 behavior is PENDING - TRAINER APPROVAL

    else Offline connectivity failure
        Note over Client,API: No HTTP response; connectivity failure occurs before a response is received
        Client-->>Repo: Report proposed connectivity error
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed offline error state
        VM-->>Activity: Retain cached tasks or show offline error and retry

    else Network timeout
        Note over Client,API: Request times out without a successful HTTP response
        Client-->>Repo: Report proposed timeout error
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed timeout error state
        VM-->>Activity: Retain cached tasks or show timeout error and retry

    else HTTP 4xx client error
        API-->>Client: Return HTTP 4xx response
        Client-->>Repo: Report proposed HTTP client error
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed client error state
        VM-->>Activity: Retain cached tasks or show client error and retry

    else HTTP 5xx server error
        API-->>Client: Return HTTP 5xx response
        Client-->>Repo: Report proposed HTTP server error
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed server error state
        VM-->>Activity: Retain cached tasks or show server error and retry

    else Malformed JSON or invalid response fields
        API-->>Client: Return malformed or incomplete JSON
        Client->>DTO: Attempt JSON deserialization
        DTO-->>Client: Report proposed parsing or validation failure
        Client-->>Repo: Report proposed response parsing error
        Repo-->>VM: Emit proposed data error state
        VM-->>Activity: Retain cached tasks or show data error and retry
    end

    Note over Repo,Activity: Cache availability rules and exact UI behavior require trainer approval

    opt User chooses Retry
        User->>Activity: Select Retry
        Activity->>VM: Trigger retry action
        VM->>Repo: Request another retrieval
        Repo->>Client: Request another API fetch
        Client->>API: Repeat proposed GET request
    end
